{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate. Face the horror. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>locked-room investigation</strong> steeped in <strong>occultism</strong>. Play as a <strong>witch hunter</strong> sent to investigate a <strong>disturbing disappearance</strong>. Search the scene, question suspects, gather clues, and uncover the truth with the <strong>freedom</strong> of a <strong>tabletop role-playing game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>An immersive narrative RPG</strong> \u2013 Each session draws you into a unique story shaped by your choices and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Investigation and exploration</strong> \u2013 Search abandoned areas, question witnesses, and gather clues to understand the lurking threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Tabletop RPG system</strong> \u2013 Roll dice for your actions, use your skills, and adapt your strategy to each situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Procedural storytelling</strong> \u2013 With every new playthrough, the story evolves with new suspects, clues, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Customization and progression</strong> \u2013 Choose a character, upgrade your skills, and tailor your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Universe</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the complex relationships within the Ashcroft family. Stay courteous or push your investigation by force, at the risk of alienating those you're meant to protect.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528000?t=1762963848","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528000/de564157df0670d4bf6bb625600309aa68d603de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762963848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.ste